abstract: >-
  Per-compound 32-dimensional program-usage vectors and harmonized
  6,000-gene response surfaces across eight combinatorial
  library-cell-line contexts, the pinned shared program basis, an
  evaluation-grade reference model, and imaging, therapeutic-hypothesis,
  chemistry, same-well, and CRISPR-phenomimicry annexes.
